# Tawjeh Level 2 — Advanced .NET Backend

## Real-World Backend Engineering — 3-Month Project Roadmap

**Duration:** 3 Months
**Structure:** 6 Sprints × 2 Weeks
**Expected Commitment:** ~15 Hours/Week
**Total:** ~180 Hours
**Project:** TeamFlow — Project & Team Operations Platform
**Architecture:** Modular Monolith / Clean Architecture
**Primary Stack:** ASP.NET Core, EF Core, SQL Server, MediatR, FluentValidation, Redis, Docker

