# 🎯 Level Objective

Level 2 is designed to move learners from building **CRUD applications** to building and reasoning about a **real-world backend system**.

The learner will progressively take the same project through:

```text
Requirements
    ↓
Domain Modeling
    ↓
Architecture
    ↓
Application Use Cases
    ↓
Security
    ↓
Business Rules
    ↓
API Engineering
    ↓
Data Access
    ↓
Performance
    ↓
Background Processing
    ↓
External Integrations
    ↓
Unit Testing
    ↓
Docker
    ↓
Deployment
```

The goal is not to introduce as many technologies as possible.

The goal is to build **one strong system** while developing the engineering judgment required to make appropriate technical decisions.

