                    API Layer
                         │
                         ▼
                Application Layer
                         │
                ┌────────┴────────┐
                ▼                 ▼
             Use Cases        Validation
                │
                ▼
              Domain
                │
                ▼
          Infrastructure
                │
        ┌───────┴────────┐
        ▼                ▼
    SQL Server      External Services
```

Suggested solution:

```text
TeamFlow.sln

src/
├── TeamFlow.Domain
├── TeamFlow.Application
├── TeamFlow.Infrastructure
└── TeamFlow.API

tests/
└── TeamFlow.UnitTests
```

The architecture should not become an exercise in creating folders.

Every architectural decision must solve an actual problem in the project.

